sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Admin
    participant B as Browser (React)
    participant S as Server (Express)
    participant FS as File System
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    Note over A,DB: Tambah Menu Baru

    A->>B: Buka halaman Menu Management
    B->>S: GET /api/menus (dengan auth header)
    S->>DB: SELECT * FROM menus JOIN categories
    DB-->>S: Daftar menu
    S-->>B: Response JSON menus
    B-->>A: Tampilkan daftar menu

    A->>B: Klik "Tambah Menu"
    A->>B: Isi form (nama, kategori, harga, deskripsi)
    A->>B: Upload file gambar
    A->>B: Tekan "Simpan"

    B->>S: POST /api/menus (multipart/form-data)
    Note right of B: Headers: Authorization: Bearer token<br/>Content-Type: multipart/form-data

    S->>S: Middleware auth: verify JWT
    S->>S: Middleware adminOnly: check role
    S->>S: Middleware upload: process file (Multer)
    S->>FS: Simpan gambar ke /uploads/{uniqueName}.ext
    S->>DB: INSERT INTO menus (nama, category_id, harga, deskripsi, gambar)
    DB-->>S: Menu created (ID)
    S->>DB: SELECT menu JOIN category WHERE id = newId
    DB-->>S: Menu with category
    S-->>B: Response 201 {menu: menuWithCategory}
    B-->>A: Tampilkan notifikasi sukses & refresh list

    Note over A,DB: Edit Menu

    A->>B: Klik "Edit" pada menu
    A->>B: Ubah data & (opsional) upload gambar baru
    B->>S: PUT /api/menus/{id} (multipart/form-data)

    S->>DB: SELECT * FROM menus WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>S: Menu data (termasuk gambar lama)

    opt Gambar baru diupload
        S->>FS: Hapus file gambar lama
        S->>FS: Simpan gambar baru
    end

    S->>DB: UPDATE menus SET ... WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>S: Updated
    S-->>B: Response {menu: updatedMenu}
    B-->>A: Tampilkan notifikasi & refresh

    Note over A,DB: Hapus Menu

    A->>B: Klik "Hapus" pada menu
    A->>B: Konfirmasi penghapusan
    B->>S: DELETE /api/menus/{id}

    S->>DB: SELECT * FROM menus WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>S: Menu data
    S->>FS: Hapus file gambar (jika ada)
    S->>DB: DELETE FROM menus WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>S: Deleted
    S-->>B: Response {message: "Menu berhasil dihapus"}
    B-->>A: Refresh daftar menu